<title>ITALY: Salomon Bros has 3.6 pct stake in Mediaset.</title>
<headline>Salomon Bros has 3.6 pct stake in Mediaset.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers International Ltd has bought  a 3.65 percent stake in Italian media group Mediaset, stock market  regulator Consob said on Friday</p>
<p>The stake in Fininvest SpA's communications group was acquired on  July 21 and is directly held by Salomon.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
